<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound average o/n widen, one-week higher.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound average o/n widen, one-week higher.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound widened in the private-sector market on Wednesday to between seven and 8-3/4 percent compared to Tuesday's range of 7-1/2 and 8-1/4 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates rose to between eight and 8-1/2 percent from 7-3/4 and 8-1/4 percent on Tuesday, they added.</p>
<p>The public sector retained its lending rate at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
